OL,3,AUK and EU agree new deal for food
OL,4,Aexports, youth mobility and emissions
OL,5,Abut student fee talks to continue
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK and EU agree a new deal covering
OL,8,Ffood exports, youth mobility and carbon
OL,9,Femissions - but talks on student
OL,10,Ftuition fees will continue
OL,12,FIt comes after the EU demanded the UK
OL,13,Fagree to cut university tuition fees
OL,14,Ffor European students, with Britain
OL,15,Fgiven six months to agree or negotiate
OL,16,Fan alternative
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
