OL,3,AUK and EU agree new deal for food
OL,4,Aexports, youth mobility and emissions
OL,5,Abut student fee talks to continue
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham calls it a "historic moment",
OL,8,Fsaying people in the UK want a "better
OL,9,Fdeal" with the EU than the "hard Brexit
OL,10,Fwe ended up with"; President of the
OL,11,FEuropean Commission Ursula von der
OL,12,FLeyen says it's a "big success"
OL,14,FSpeaking to the BBC earlier, Reform's
OL,15,FNigel Farage - a prominent Brexit
OL,16,Fcampaigner - said the PM has no
OL,17,F"democratic mandate to do any of this"
OL,18,F- here's what other political leaders
OL,19,Fhave said
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
