OL,3,ARussian missile hits Poland as
OL,4,AUkraine's allies hold military
OL,5,Aexercise, says Tusk
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussia has made no comment about the
OL,8,Fviolations, which took place during one
OL,9,Fof its biggest aerial attacks on
OL,10,FUkraine since the start of the
OL,11,Ffull-scale invasion in 2022.
OL,13,FDefence Minister Wladyslaw
OL,14,FKosiniak-Kamysz said the Kh-101 missile
OL,15,Fhit a rural area at Nowy Lipowiec in
OL,16,Fsoutheastern Poland about 50km (31
OL,17,Fmiles) from the Ukrainian border.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
